  "access_rule": "The first tier draws on the narrow 17-body geometry/science-name screen. The second uses only the mass of the broader dark catalogue outside that set. Fractions represent hypothetical qualified feed allowances, not assigned mines. All allowances are assumed available from the first modeled year for a stock-only comparison; annual qualification and delivery rates remain unestablished.",
